,{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m076-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"鄭君","kind":"person","person_id":"sy5_s6h_9ex","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m076-0079","start":79,"end":82,"surface":"秦繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m076-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"秦伯","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p019","text":"三十六年，晉公子重耳過，文公弗禮。文公弟叔詹曰：「重耳賢，且又同姓，窮而過君，不可無禮。」文公曰：「諸侯亡公子過者多矣，安能盡禮之！」詹曰：「君如弗禮，遂殺之；弗殺，使卽反國，爲鄭憂矣。」文公弗聽。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0005","start":5,"end":10,"surface":"晉公子重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"xfa_rw3_95j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"叔詹","kind":"person","person_id":"67y_7vs_x2g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"xfa_rw3_95j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"詹","kind":"person","person_id":"67y_7vs_x2g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m019-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p021","text":"四十一年，助楚撃晉。自晉文公之過無禮，故背晉助楚。四十三年，晉文公與秦穆公共圍鄭，討其助楚攻晉者，及文公過時之無禮也。初，鄭文公有三夫人，寵子五人，皆以罪蚤死。公怒，溉逐群公子。子蘭奔晉，從晉文公圍鄭。時蘭事晉文公甚謹，愛幸之，乃私於晉，以求入鄭爲太子。晉於是欲得叔詹爲僇。鄭文公恐，不敢謂叔詹言。詹聞，言於鄭君曰：「臣謂君，君不聽臣，晉卒爲患。然晉所以圍鄭，以詹，詹死而赦鄭國，詹之願也。」乃自殺。鄭人以詹尸與晉。晉文公曰：「必欲一見鄭君，辱之而去。」鄭人患之，乃使人私於秦曰：「破鄭益晉，非秦之利也。」秦兵罷。晉文公欲入蘭爲太子，以告鄭。鄭大夫石癸曰：「吾聞姞姓乃后稷之元妃，其後當有興者。子蘭母，其後也。且夫人子盡已死，餘庶子無如蘭賢。今圍急，晉以爲請，利孰大焉！」遂許晉，與盟，而卒立子蘭爲太子，晉兵乃罷去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"xfa_rw3_95j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"xfa_rw3_95j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"秦穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"4hw_5vr_bqf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"xfa_rw3_95j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0061","start":61,"end":64,"surface":"鄭文公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0065","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"三夫人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0069","start":69,"end":73,"surface":"寵子五人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"群公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、夢中或神祇指代及提議用稱保留；不補姓名、個人成員或授位事實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m021-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"子蘭","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_BAA","status":